  "description": "The perfect bike for anyone that’s taken a break from BMX and is wanting to get back into the sport or coming from the MTB world and looking for something a little bigger and more stable than a 20”. With classic FIT colorways, graphics and pad-sets, these well-spec’d bikes are the perfect bikes to keep the good times rolling. S&M Speedball tires and double wall rims keep the slightly larger rims on track and running true. The S&M 320mm Long Johnson post with Quick Release clamp and S&M Stealth Pivotal seat are great for longer rides to the local spots. With thread-on brake mounts, this otherwise trail/park savvy big rig can instantly become a brakeless street shredder as well. The Seies 22 is a cutting-edge BMX size with a classic FIT look and feel.",
